title: Legislative agenda
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: sp_government
view-if: player_in_government = 1 and pm_is_pp = 0 and law_timer <= 0
frequency: 80

= The legislative agenda

Bills go to Congress. Ordinary laws need more yes than no votes; organic laws need an absolute majority of 176. A law passed once can only be expanded or repealed. Partners who dislike a bill will say so in public.

- @pass_imv: Present the Minimum Living Income
- @pass_euthanasia: Present the Euthanasia Law
- @pass_education: Present the Education reform (LOMLOE)
- @pass_memory: Present the Democratic Memory Law
- @pass_consent: Present the Only Yes Means Yes
- @pass_housing: Present the Housing Law
- @pass_trans: Present the Trans and LGBTI Rights Law
- @pass_animal: Present the Animal Welfare Law
- @pass_wealth: Present the Solidarity tax on large fortunes
- @pass_amnesty: Present the Amnesty Law
- @expand_imv: Expand the Minimum Living Income
- @expand_euthanasia: Expand the Euthanasia Law
- @expand_education: Expand the Education reform (LOMLOE)
- @expand_memory: Expand the Democratic Memory Law
- @expand_consent: Expand the Only Yes Means Yes
- @expand_housing: Expand the Housing Law
- @expand_trans: Expand the Trans and LGBTI Rights Law
- @expand_animal: Expand the Animal Welfare Law
- @expand_wealth: Expand the Solidarity tax on large fortunes
- @expand_amnesty: Expand the Amnesty Law
- @repeal_imv: Repeal the Minimum Living Income
- @repeal_euthanasia: Repeal the Euthanasia Law
- @repeal_education: Repeal the Education reform (LOMLOE)
- @repeal_memory: Repeal the Democratic Memory Law
- @repeal_consent: Repeal the Only Yes Means Yes
- @repeal_housing: Repeal the Housing Law
- @repeal_trans: Repeal the Trans and LGBTI Rights Law
- @repeal_animal: Repeal the Animal Welfare Law
- @repeal_wealth: Repeal the Solidarity tax on large fortunes
- @repeal_amnesty: Repeal the Amnesty Law
- @root: Not this month

@pass_imv
title: Pass: Minimum Living Income
view-if: law_can_imv = 1
subtitle: Likely count: [+ law_odds_imv +]
on-arrival: {! Q.month_actions += 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.voteLaw(Q, 'imv', 'pass'); } !}
go-to: law_won if law_passed_now = 1; law_lost if law_passed_now = 0

